  m_text: 'Survive every wave and keep your <b>Base</b> alive.


    Fallen enemies
    leave corpses. <b>Raise them</b> into minions that fight for you.


    Build
    <b>towers</b> on empty slots, then level up to choose new skills.


    If the
    Base or the Necromancer falls, the night is lost.'
